    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28995" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῠσεργ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>difficulty in working</i> or
				<i>construction</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσεργίαν παρέχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					<u>Bel.</u>
					56.42
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Aut.</u>
				23.8
			</span></i> (in form -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έργεια</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Aem.</u>
				16
			</span></i>; <i>difficulty</i> in pronouncing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐν τῇ προφορᾷ δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Po.</u>
					2.42
				</span></i>
			; <i>inability to exert oneself</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				10
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσοργίη</span>
			); <i>inability to act</i>, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Syr.</u>
				19
			</span></i>.</div>
